@startuml ZendaSystemContext
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

title Zenda -- System Context

actor "University Student\n(18-24, Lima)" as User
actor "Developer / Admin" as Dev

rectangle "Zenda Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
rectangle "Zenda API\n(NestJS + PostgreSQL)" as API
cloud "Azure AI Foundry\n(GPT-4o-mini fine-tuned)" as AI
cloud "Email Provider\n(nodemailer / SMTP)" as Email
cloud "Firebase Cloud Messaging\n(Phase 11)" as FCM

User --> App : records transactions\nviews reports\ncompletes challenges
App --> API : HTTPS/REST + JWT
API --> AI : spending context (Phase 8+)
AI --> API : predictions + advice (JSON)
API --> Email : password reset emails
API --> FCM : push notifications (Phase 11)
Dev --> API : Swagger UI (/api/docs)

@enduml
